    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d679-a1">

                <pb facs="1241" n="1117" sameAs="frus:frus1881/pg1117"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No. 343.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Byers to Mr.
                            Fish.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >United States Consulate</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Zurich</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1881-01-29"><hi rendition="#italic">January</hi> 29,
                        1881</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I beg to hand you herewith a list of
                    persons, and their ages, who have been “assisted” to emigrate to the United
                    States from the town of Gersau since the 22d day of August, 1880. This list
                    furnished me by the authorities is presumably correct.</p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>S. H. M. BYERS.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
